 sy-q 448 take-n
 0 32 range ('i-i let i-i 1 band 1 eq i-i 30 lt and (i-i 1 shr 1 plus 'sy-y nth must) (448 i-i plus 'sy-q nth must) if) each cat
 m3-hmap ('sy-y nth must) each cat 'sy-h let
