   18 'sl-a nth must -1.0 fmul 50 'sl-a nth must -49.0 fmul fplus 82 'sl-a nth must 228.0 fmul fplus 114 'sl-a nth must -848.0 fmul fplus 146 'sl-a nth must 1644.0 fmul fplus 178 'sl-a nth must -7271.0 fmul fplus 210 'sl-a nth must 2037.0 fmul fplus 242 'sl-a nth must -48390.0 fmul fplus 274 'sl-a nth must 73415.0 fmul fplus 306 'sl-a nth must 26482.0 fmul fplus 338 'sl-a nth must 9139.0 fmul fplus 370 'sl-a nth must 3004.0 fmul fplus 402 'sl-a nth must 2057.0 fmul fplus 434 'sl-a nth must 153.0 fmul fplus 466 'sl-a nth must 176.0 fmul fplus 498 'sl-a nth must 16.0 fmul fplus m3-pcm
   20 'sl-a nth must -1.0 fmul 52 'sl-a nth must -45.0 fmul fplus 84 'sl-a nth must 228.0 fmul fplus 116 'sl-a nth must -779.0 fmul fplus 148 'sl-a nth must 1739.0 fmul fplus 180 'sl-a nth must -6935.0 fmul fplus 212 'sl-a nth must 2935.0 fmul fplus 244 'sl-a nth must -46617.0 fmul fplus 276 'sl-a nth must 73908.0 fmul fplus 308 'sl-a nth must 28289.0 fmul fplus 340 'sl-a nth must 8840.0 fmul fplus 372 'sl-a nth must 3351.0 fmul fplus 404 'sl-a nth must 2075.0 fmul fplus 436 'sl-a nth must 197.0 fmul fplus 468 'sl-a nth must 183.0 fmul fplus 500 'sl-a nth must 17.0 fmul fplus m3-pcm
